'''Year's First Dawn''' was a special stage that appears during the first eight days of a new year. When clearing it, you would get an amount of XP similar to the number of the year.

==Stages==
*[[First Sunrise!]] (2015)
*[[Year's First Dawn (2016)|Year's First Dawn]] (2016)
*[[Year's First Dawn (2017)|Year's First Dawn]] (2017)
*[[Year's First Dawn (2018)|Year's First Dawn]] (2018)
*[[Year's First Dawn (2019)|Year's First Dawn]] (2019)
*[[Happy 2020!]] (2020)

==Differences==
{{Collapsible}}
*Differences for 2015
**[[Baa Baa]] this year.
**Costed 27 Energy.
**20% chance for 2,015 XP.
**Base has 2015 health.
**Stage originally called '''First Sunrise!'''

*Differences for 2016
**[[Gory]] this year.
**Costed 28 Energy.
**Timed Score reward.
**Base has 2016 health.
**Stage was called '''Auld Lang Syne!'''

*Differences for 2017
**[[Jackie Peng]] this year.
**Costed 29 Energy.
**Base has 2,017 health.

*Differences for 2018
**[[Doge]] this year.
**Costed 30 energy.
**Base has 2,018 health.

*Differences for 2019
**[[Li'l Bore]] this year.
**Costed 31 energy.
**Base has 2,019 health.
**Stage was called '''New Year's Dawn!'''

*Differences for 2020
**[[Rat Doge]] this year.
**Costed 2 energy.
